# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / Linux 混用导致整个文件 diff 爆炸
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.db binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary

# 语言统计：文档不算代码
*.md linguist-documentation
docs-代码说明书/* linguist-documentation
